    "detailed_description": "<strong>Hell Takes All</strong> is a randomly generated rogue-like tower defense game that throws thousands of enemies at you, with your cactuses being the only defense at your disposal. You start as a tiny demon seeking revenge on the Devil. Strategically choose and upgrade your cacti, discover powerful items, and unleash your chosen abilities to create powerful builds. Conquer hell and transform the devil into your subservient ally!",
